# Implementation

Server-first. `action/<segment>/` mirrors routes — one mutation → `auth.api` → `updateTag` when needed.

Suspense only on request-API slices. Auth gate inline at segment layout (`auth.api.getSession`) — not before `auth.api`.

Next.js: inspect `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` under `apps/web` before coding — never web-search ([nextjs.md](docs/agents/nextjs.md)).

Storage uploads: owner scope → `auth.api` → cleanup → cache invalidation — [implementation.md § Storage](docs/agents/implementation.md#storage-uploads).

